WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.534 --> 00:00:15.097
The kids went up to the attic.

2
00:00:15.097 --> 00:00:19.515
It was very dark and dusty.

3
00:00:19.515 --> 00:00:26.961
They saw things to play with.

4
00:00:26.961 --> 00:00:32.383
"Old books!" Emmy said.

5
00:00:32.383 --> 00:00:35.687
"Old toys!" Harry said.

6
00:00:35.687 --> 00:00:38.515
Oliver looked around.

7
00:00:38.515 --> 00:00:45.881
"There's a ghost in the corner!" he said.

8
00:00:45.881 --> 00:00:52.229
"There's no such thing as ghosts," Harry said.

9
00:00:52.229 --> 00:00:56.496
"You imagined it," Emmy said.

10
00:00:56.496 --> 00:01:04.300
Thump! "I did not imagine it!" Oliver said.

11
00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:09.352
"It was just the wind," Harry said.

12
00:01:09.352 --> 00:01:13.504
"Let's get some flashlights," Emmy said.

13
00:01:13.504 --> 00:01:18.158
The kids went back to the attic with flashlights.

14
00:01:18.158 --> 00:01:26.294
Harry walked toward the old toys.

15
00:01:26.294 --> 00:01:34.947
He gasped. "One is missing!"

16
00:01:34.947 --> 00:01:45.871
Thump! "That was not the wind!" Oliver said.

17
00:01:45.871 --> 00:01:49.521
Emmy looked at the old books.

18
00:01:49.521 --> 00:01:57.937
"A book is missing too!" she said.

19
00:01:57.937 --> 00:02:03.515
"This attic is haunted!" Oliver said.

20
00:02:03.515 --> 00:02:07.786
Emmy shined her flashlight.

21
00:02:07.786 --> 00:02:12.674
"I see some hair," she said.

22
00:02:12.674 --> 00:02:16.715
"Ghosts don't have hair."

23
00:02:16.715 --> 00:02:20.071
Harry shined his flashlight.

24
00:02:20.071 --> 00:02:24.742
"I see paw prints in the dust!

25
00:02:24.742 --> 00:02:28.407
Ghosts don't have paws."

26
00:02:28.407 --> 00:02:31.435
Oliver took a deep breath.

27
00:02:31.435 --> 00:02:34.644
He stepped toward the corner.

28
00:02:34.644 --> 00:02:37.944
Something was there.

29
00:02:37.944 --> 00:02:43.838
It was . . .

30
00:02:43.838 --> 00:02:48.096
"Rover!" Oliver cried.

31
00:02:48.096 --> 00:02:50.874
Rover was chewing on the toy.

32
00:02:50.874 --> 00:02:53.766
The book lay nearby.

33
00:02:53.766 --> 00:03:00.174
The kids laughed.

34
00:03:00.174 --> 00:03:04.794
"Rover followed us up here," said Emmy.

35
00:03:04.794 --> 00:03:07.895
Oliver patted the dog.

36
00:03:07.895 --> 00:03:19.796
"Rover likes the attic too!"
